-- Quests for each dungeon: who gives them, where, for which faction.
--
-- Built from two sources on 2026-11-17:
--   * the WoW Forever dungeon quest guides on warcrafttavern.com (which quests
--     belong to which dungeon, and the quests that are new in Forever), and
--   * the QuestieDB Forever database (github.com/Questie/QuestieDB): quest
--     giver, turn-in NPC, level, faction and the givers' map coordinates.
-- Coordinates are percent across / percent down the zone map. A row with
-- approx = true has a coordinate guessed from a guide's description; the new
-- Forever quests have coordinates from the guides, unverified in game.
--
-- Row fields:
--   id, name, level (lowest level to take it), faction "A" / "H" / "B" (both)
--   qlevel    the quest's own level (decides when it stops giving experience);
--             from QuestieDB, missing on the new Forever quests
--   classes   class-only quest ("Rogue", "Mage" ...)
--   giver     who starts it; start = "item" or "object" when it is not an NPC,
--             from = what drops the item
--   zone,x,y  where the giver stands; inside = true when it starts in the dungeon
--   turnin    who takes it back when not the giver; tzone,tx,ty or tinside
--   pre       quests to do first;  note  what to do / extra hints
